        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Perceptions of Impact of 911 Call Center Technology on Patient Safety</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 8.5in;\n    min-height: 11in;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0.30in 0.55in 0.25in 0.55in;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .running-head, .running-foot {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 17pt;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n  }\n  .running-head {\n    margin-bottom: 0.55in;\n  }\n  .running-foot {\n    margin-top: auto;\n    padding-top: 0.35in;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.35in;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 0 0.30in;\n  }\n  /* Banner placeholder */\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #9aa4ad;\n    background: #f4f6f8;\n    color: #55606a;\n    font-size: 10pt;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .banner {\n    width: 6.55in;\n    height: 1.15in;\n    margin: 0 0 0.10in 0.28in;\n  }\n  /* Navigation */\n  nav {\n    margin: 0.12in 0 0.05in 0.28in;\n    font-size: 12.5pt;\n  }\n  nav .navrow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    margin-bottom: 0.16in;\n  }\n  nav a {\n    color: #1a4e8a;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  nav .navrow.row1 a:nth-child(1) { width: 1.60in; }\n  nav .navrow.row1 a:nth-child(2) { width: 1.05in; }\n  nav .navrow.row1 a:nth-child(3) { width: 1.40in; }\n  nav .navrow.row1 a:nth-child(4) { width: 0.90in; }\n  nav .navrow.row1 a:nth-child(5) { width: 1.00in; }\n  nav .navrow.row2 a:nth-child(1) { width: 1.60in; }\n  nav .navrow.row2 a:nth-child(2) { width: 1.15in; }\n\n  h1.doc-title {\n    font-size: 20pt;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    color: #7d7d7d;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0.18in 0 0.10in 0;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    border: 0;\n    border-top: 3px solid #1f5fa9;\n    margin: 0 0 0.30in 0;\n  }\n  .session-meta {\n    margin: 0 0 0.35in 0.62in;\n    font-size: 11.5pt;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .session-meta .bold { font-weight: bold; }\n  .session-meta .loc { font-style: italic; }\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 14.5pt;\n    margin: 0.30in 0 0.18in 0.15in;\n  }\n  .board-number {\n    margin: 0 0 0.45in 0.62in;\n    font-size: 11.5pt;\n    color: #4a4a4a;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    padding-left: 0.15in;\n    font-size: 11pt;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .body-text h3 {\n    font-size: 11.5pt;\n    margin: 0.16in 0 0.10in 0;\n  }\n  .body-text p {\n    margin: 0 0 0.14in 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .table-caption {\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 11pt;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0.18in 0 0.18in 0;\n    padding-left: 0.15in;\n  }\n  table.data {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-left: 0.15in;\n    font-size: 11pt;\n  }\n  table.data th, table.data td {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding: 0.075in 0.10in 0.075in 0;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  table.data th.grouphead {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding-bottom: 0.12in;\n  }\n  table.data td.rowlabel, table.data th.rowlabel {\n    width: 2.00in;\n  }\n  table.data td.mean, table.data th.mean { width: 0.60in; }\n  table.data td.ci, table.data th.ci { width: 1.05in; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"running-head\">\n    <span>2018 Annual Research Meeting</span>\n    <span>Page 1 of 2</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder banner\" style=\"margin-left:0.28in;\">\n    [Banner image: AcademyHealth Annual Research Meeting — \"TODAY'S RESEARCH DRIVING TOMORROW'S OUTCOMES\" / June 24-26, 2018, Seattle, Washington — top center]\n  </figure>\n\n  <nav>\n    <div class=\"navrow row1\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Schedule By Day</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Themes</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Session Types</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Posters</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">People</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Exhibitor</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"navrow row2\">\n      <a href=\"#\">Sponsors</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Resources</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">2018 Interest Groups&nbsp;&#x2197;</a>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <h1 class=\"doc-title\">Perceptions of Impact of 911 Call Center Technology on Patient Safety</h1>\n  <hr class=\"rule\">\n\n  <div class=\"session-meta\">\n    <span class=\"bold\">Monday, June 25, 2018</span><br>\n    <span class=\"bold\">06:45 PM - 08:15 PM</span><br>\n    <span class=\"loc\">&#x1F4CD; Washington State Convention Center - Exhibit Hall 4AB</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>Poster Board Number</h2>\n  <div class=\"board-number\">&#x27A4; C-272</div>\n\n  <div class=\"body-text\">\n    <h3>Research Objective:</h3>\n    <p>Activation of the medical emergency services system begins with a call to 911. Performance on call receivers can directly impact patient safety, especially for life threatening emergencies such as cardiac arrest (1). New technologies, such as cell phone texting to 911 (text2911), automobile crash notification (OnStar), pre-registration of household emergency information (Smart911) and ability to send videos of an incident (Visuals), are being implemented across the country as part of the Next Generation 9-1-1 (NG911) initiative. NG911 technologies provide additional or alternative avenues other than voice for contacting 911.</p>\n\n    <h3>Study Design:</h3>\n    <p>A cross-sectional survey that included questions on the perceived impact of new technologies on call receiver performance, responder safety and patient safety was administered as part of a longitudinal study. Survey items (using a 7 point Likert-type scale) included questions regarding the perceptions of 911 employees on the impact of the technologies on: the quality and usefulness of the information in a call; time it takes to process a call; quality of job performance; and helpfulness of each technology for decision making, ability to convey pre-arrival instruction, ability to protect the safety of responders and ability to protect safety of the public.</p>\n\n    <h3>Population Studied:</h3>\n    <p>Emergency call center employees (n=165) from 23 call centers across the United States.</p>\n\n    <h3>Principal Findings:</h3>\n    <p>The impact of text2911 on performance was uniformly perceived more negatively than Onstar, Smart911 or Visuals (table 1).</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"table-caption\">\n    Table 1. Perceptions of text2911, Onstar, Smart911 and visuals on performance and safety compared to voice calls. Responses were on a 7 point Likert-type scale ranging from 1 = much worse to 7 = much better.\n  </div>\n\n  <table class=\"data\">\n    <tr>\n      <th class=\"rowlabel\"></th>\n      <th class=\"grouphead\" colspan=\"2\">Text2911</th>\n      <th class=\"grouphead\" colspan=\"2\">Onstar</th>\n      <th class=\"grouphead\" colspan=\"2\">Smart911</th>\n      <th class=\"grouphead\" colspan=\"2\">Visuals</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th class=\"rowlabel\"></th>\n      <th class=\"mean\">Mean</th><th class=\"ci\">(95% CI)</th>\n      <th class=\"mean\">Mean</th><th class=\"ci\">(95% CI)</th>\n      <th class=\"mean\">Mean</th><th class=\"ci\">(95% CI)</th>\n      <th class=\"mean\">Mean</th><th class=\"ci\">(95% CI)</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel\">Helpfulness</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.2</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.0, 3.4)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.9</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.7, 4.1)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">4.3</td><td class=\"ci\">(4.1, 4.5)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.9</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.7, 4.1)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel\">Information</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">2.5</td><td class=\"ci\">(2.3, 2.7)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.6</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.4, 3.8)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">4.4</td><td class=\"ci\">(4.1, 4.7)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">4.2</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.9, 4.4)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel\">Instructions</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">2.6</td><td class=\"ci\">(2.4, 2.8)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.4</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.2, 3.6)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.8</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.6, 4.1)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.4</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.2, 3.7)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel\">Interactions</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">2.8</td><td class=\"ci\">(2.6, 3.0)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.5</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.3, 3.7)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">4.1</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.8, 4.3)</td>\n      <td class=\"mean\">3.4</td><td class=\"ci\">(3.1, 3.6)</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"running-foot\">\n    <span>https://academyhealth.confex.com/academyhealth/2018arm/meetingapp.cgi/Paper/26761</span>\n    <span>8/28/2019</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
